          "item": {
            "@type": "NewsArticle",
            "headline": "Anthropic's Claude Now Writes Over 90% of Its Own Code, CFO Krishna Rao Reveals",
            "articleSection": "Job Evolution",
            "abstract": "Anthropic CFO Krishna Rao has disclosed that Claude, the company's flagship AI model, now generates more than 90% of Anthropic's internal codebase, a striking indicator of how AI is reshaping even the most AI-native workplaces. Despite this automation, Anthropic is continuing to hire, positioning AI as an amplifier of human talent rather than a replacement. The disclosure has immediate relevance for Indian software engineers and IT professionals who face growing pressure to justify their roles as AI coding tools mature.",
            "url": "https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/tech/artificial-intelligence/anthropics-claude-writes-90-of-code-cfo-krishna-rao-reveals-productivity-gains/articleshow/131121594.cms",
